        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "What a fantastic place. We did a stop on the way in Montreal, and we will definitely return.\n\nLove it!\nFantastic flavours, great prices, and even better service. The ratings are legit.",
        "time": 1760055595,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Boris Jezdimir",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104655289431561547396/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJLtxfHc5viusfPdo5u6tidWAK5vUgNSdnH8AadGnNE3tnzIQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Tiny portions, the butter chicken was literally a soup with 8 small pieces of chicken. Other portions of our 108$ order were also extremely disappointing. I’d assume it was a lazy employee as we ordered take out 1h before close, given the great reviews. Still extremely disappointed as a first time customer and will NEVER go back. Dawat is half the price and 20x better.",
        "time": 1768961205,
        "translated": false
      },
